ething people might actually enjoy. Seeing four digits on that download counter feels completely surreal. Every single play, wishlist, and message means more to us than you know.What We’re Working On NextWe’ve been obsessively reading through all ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:37:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925837","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4961960-1845383656380660","game_id":"steam-4961960","kind":"announcement","title":"No Witnesses DEMO Available Now!","summary":"Hi Witnesses, Things have been a little hectic round here since we launched the FREE DEMO of No Witnesses and it's really cool to see everyone downloading and playing our game!One thing that has cropped up is that the DEMO isn't intended for just one player, feel free to download the DEMO and come back with friends or search for a public lobby to join and make friends, though! Dedicated servers are a part of our release plan and we're hoping if there is a demand to release the server files so pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T10:15:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380660","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4961960-1842212951306451","game_id":"steam-4961960","kind":"announcement","title":"August 2026 - Dev Log","summary":"Hi All,Just a quick post to keep you all up to date with the current state of affairs for No Witnesses, a little peak behind the curtain of what's been going on behind the scenes.Release Date AnnouncementWe've set our official release date for No Witnesses, the game will be released on: Oct 29, 2026 3:00 PM GMTRelease UpdatesWe've had a bit of back-and-forth thinking about whether launching in Early Access or not is the right thing for No Witnesses. When we made the decision to release in Early ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T21:08:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951306451","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4961960-1839676055887919","game_id":"steam-4961960","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 100 Wishlists! Thank You!","summary":"Hey everyone,We just hit 100 Wishlists for No Witnesses!It might sound like a small milestone to some, but as indie devs, seeing the first 100 people hit that button means the world to us. Knowing there's an actual community out there excited to see where this game goes keeps us going.A huge thank you to everyone who wishlisted, requested playtest access, reported bugs, or just hung out in the Discord. You’re directly helping us shape No Witnesses into something special.If you haven't wishlisted","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T11:46:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887919","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4961960-1839041357036374","game_id":"steam-4961960","kind":"announcement","title":"PUBLIC PLAYTEST #1","summary":"Hey everyone!The moment is finally here, No Witnesses Public Playtest #1! We've been working hard behind the scenes, but now we need real players to jump in, break things and tell us what feels good and what doesn't!What are we testing?This test is all about getting the core gameplay loop into your hands. We want to see how the mechanics hold up in real-world situations, catch performance hiccups across different setups and gather your thoughts on how the game feels. We're aiming for key feedbac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T17:30:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4961960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4961960":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4961960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z"},"5041390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:18Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4961960","app_id":4961960,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"71b4cc12148a9ff6d882ba01b8140b69b028fd81eb97808c915c683238e7086a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"No Witnesses는 2-16명 파티 게임입니다. 온라인으로, 혹은 친구들과 함께 플레이하세요. 이 로비의 누군가는 살인마입니다. 아무도 그 장면을 보지 못했죠. 살인마는 군중 속에 숨고, 목격자는 살아남으려 발버둥치고, 탐정은 현장을 감식합니다 - 그 와중에 버프와 디버프가 매 라운드를 혼돈으로 몰아넣죠. 아무도 믿지 마세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Pink Thorn Games","creator_clan_account_id":46211169}],"developers":[{"name":"Pink Thorn Games","creator_clan_account_id":46211169}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"NW Trailer 1","trailer_url_format":"stea